  "details": "Since the late IK2.0 update, shoulder tracking with elbow trackers has been implemented, but this has caused a number of avatars to behave strangely.\nCurrently, shoulder tracking can be turned off in the startup options, but this is not very convenient as it requires a restart of the game to take effect.\nShoulder tracking works differently for different avatars. Therefore, I would like to be able to toggle shoulder tracking on and off from the in-game menu.",
